D1 (2026-11-06): the run stopped and resumed, with no change to its method. It was paused while SWE-QA used the GPU, then stopped by the low-disk guard at 44 of 58 `edit2ripple` samples, and its embedding cache
  was deleted to free disk. The cache only saves time, so results don't change. `run_tracks.sh` now skips finished tracks and clears the cache between tracks. A 2-sample smoke test of `trace2code` ran before the full
  run, after PROTOCOL.md was hashed; its results were deleted and those samples ran again.
